[en.IDEA_C01_FAST_TRAINING]
Simplest Training Paradigm

[en.IDEA_C01_FAST_TRAINING_desc]
What is a better way to learn how to swim than being tossed into the deep end without a life jacket?
Exactly, who needs pesky training and preparation when you can experience the exhilarating thrill of combat straight out of the recruitment office!

[zh.IDEA_C01_FAST_TRAINING]
最简训练程式

[zh.IDEA_C01_FAST_TRAINING_desc]
难道有什么比被直接扔进深水区不带救生衣更好的学习游泳的方法呢？
同样的，谁需要烦人的训练和准备？不如刚从征兵登记处出来就直接体验战斗的刺激！
